 *
 *  - `'top'` / `'left'`:    `+1` — items grow at increasing chart coord
 *  - `'bottom'` / `'right'`: `-1` — items grow at decreasing chart coord
 *  - `'middle'`:              `0` — items spread symmetrically (algorithm
 *    treats this specially, not multiplied)
